","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"9b3a90ad15c9d9cce7312d96e1753b58907a0a54","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BeniCheni/elenchus/commits/9b3a90ad15c9d9cce7312d96e1753b58907a0a54","html_url":"https://github.com/BeniCheni/elenchus/commit/9b3a90ad15c9d9cce7312d96e1753b58907a0a54"}]},{"sha":"d737ceb18b5fbecc4c43537a37223c963566bdd3","node_id":"C_kwDOVws8odoAKGQ3MzdjZWIxOGI1ZmJlY2M0YzQzNTM3YTM3MjIzYzk2MzU2NmJkZDM","commit":{"author":{"name":"Claude","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","date":"2026-11-14T15:35:23Z"},"committer":{"name":"Claude","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","date":"2026-11-14T15:37:20Z"},"message":"Record PR #320's out-of-scope rows and review notes in the ideas file\n\nRows 118 to 123: the tab row's 4 px margin at 375 and its font-swap shift,\nthe heroes' empty copy, the removal audit as a standing test, the retained\nnext-fixture markers, \"1 MATCHES\", and the proof scripts N7 inherits. Rows\n10 and the month half of 11 close by removal. The process notes carry what\nthis cold review learned about attributing a flake, testing a removal by\nmutation, and measuring a row with the webfont late, plus the skill retro.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"854681faf2dfdf4fc80d5084d2f1fac9aafd3845","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BeniCheni/elenchus/git/trees/854681faf2dfdf4fc80d5084d2f1fac9aafd3845"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BeniCheni/elenchus/git/commits/d737ceb18b5fbecc4c43537a37223c963566bdd3","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null}},"url":"https:/